units lj
atom_style bond
boundary p p p
read_data dimer.data
pair_style zero 2.5
pair_coeff * *
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 100 1
neighbor 0.3 bin
timestep 0.005
fix integrate all nve
fix force all setforce 0 0 0
fix constraint all shake 1e-10 100 0 b 1
thermo 100
dump positions all custom 1 trajectory.dump id xu yu zu vx vy vz
dump_modify positions sort id format float %.17g
run 200
